{"product_id":"taom-fusion-cue-tip","title":"Taom Fusion Cue Tip","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTaom Fusion Cue Tip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is engineered for players who want a powerful, precise, and responsive hit without sacrificing touch and control. Its unique hybrid construction combines a \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ehardened center with softer, more elastic edges\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, creating a balanced response that delivers efficient power transfer while maintaining excellent feel around the cue ball.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstructed from \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e7 layers of high-quality pigskin leather\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, the Fusion is designed to provide consistent energy transfer and a controlled, confident response across a wide range of shots. The firmer center supports powerful cue-ball action, while the softer outer edges help deliver the touch and control needed for precise positional play.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeatures\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e7-layer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e premium pigskin leather construction\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHardened center for efficient power transmission\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSofter, more elastic edges for enhanced control and feel\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBalanced combination of power, precision, and responsiveness\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned for consistent performance across different shot types\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e14mm diameter\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e for pool cues\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAdvanced hybrid construction by Taom\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFirm, controlled playing response\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect For\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlayers looking for a premium cue tip that combines \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epower and control in one design\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. The Taom Fusion delivers a confident, responsive hit—from delicate positional shots to powerful cue-ball actions.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePower when you need it. Touch when it matters. The Taom Fusion delivers both.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43487076220976,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/s-l1200.jpg?v=1786676292","url":"https:\/\/cuesmastershop.com\/products\/taom-fusion-cue-tip","provider":"Cues Master Shop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}